{
    "title": "FOX23 News Tulsa",
    "description": "FOX23 News KOKI is serving coverage you can count on for Oklahoma as it happens with our 24/7 news app. Dig deeper on the major news of the day with our live and on-demand videos to keep you plugged in to what\u2019s happening now. \r\n\r\nFOX23 News KOKI is your guide to: \r\n\r\n\r\n- Minute-by-minute weather using FOX23\u2019s StormTracker Doppler Radar and 5-day Forecast so you know how the weather will impact you. \r\n- Getting where you need to go on time with live drive times in and out of the Tulsa Metro Area.\r\n- Direct sports coverage of the Oklahoma City Thunder, University of Oklahoma, Oklahoma State University, and more. \r\n- Local news that matters for Tulsa, Osage, Washington, Nowata, Craig, Pawnee, Ottawa, Rogers, Mayes, Delaware, Wagoner, Creek, Cherokee, Adair, Okfuskee, Okmulgee, Muskogee, Sequoya, McIntosh, Haskell, Pittsburg, College, Latimer, Hughes, Chautauqua, and Montgomery counties. \r\n- National and world and what it means for you. \r\n- Engaging content that you can share easily from the app to Twitter and Facebook.\r\n\r\nGet accessible coverage that keeps you up-to-date with FOX23 News. \r\n\r\nContinued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life.",
    "descriptionHTML": "FOX23 News KOKI is serving coverage you can count on for Oklahoma as it happens with our 24/7 news app. Dig deeper on the major news of the day with our live and on-demand videos to keep you plugged in to what\u2019s happening now. <br><br>FOX23 News KOKI is your guide to: <br><br><br>- Minute-by-minute weather using FOX23\u2019s StormTracker Doppler Radar and 5-day Forecast so you know how the weather will impact you. <br>- Getting where you need to go on time with live drive times in and out of the Tulsa Metro Area.<br>- Direct sports coverage of the Oklahoma City Thunder, University of Oklahoma, Oklahoma State University, and more. <br>- Local news that matters for Tulsa, Osage, Washington, Nowata, Craig, Pawnee, Ottawa, Rogers, Mayes, Delaware, Wagoner, Creek, Cherokee, Adair, Okfuskee, Okmulgee, Muskogee, Sequoya, McIntosh, Haskell, Pittsburg, College, Latimer, Hughes, Chautauqua, and Montgomery counties. <br>- National and world and what it means for you. <br>- Engaging content that you can share easily from the app to Twitter and Facebook.<br><br>Get accessible coverage that keeps you up-to-date with FOX23 News. <br><br>Continued use of GPS running in the background can dramatically decrease battery life.",
